,{"@id":"lean:QOU.ComplexChiralityRotation.ComplexChiralityRotation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ComplexChiralityRotation.ComplexChiralityRotation","kind":"class","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/complex-chirality-rotation.lean#L42-L49","doc":"**Complex-chirality-rotation conjecture** (class-axiomatised\nper §3b-cond). Algebraic tier only — the CP-suppression\nnumerical bound `δ_CP = O(θ²)` belongs to a future\nArchimedean tier per gemini review on #721. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:complex-chirality-rotation","label":"conj:complex-chirality-rotation","md":"quantum-observable-universe/observations/complex-chirality-rotation.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ComplexChiralityRotation.CPTAsQuotientHolds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ComplexChiralityRotation.CPTAsQuotientHolds","kind":"opaque","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/complex-chirality-rotation.lean#L36-L40","doc":"**Sub-claim (3: CPT as ℤ/2 quotient)**: the observable sector\n(`θ = 0`) sees the `U(1)` chirality rotation only modulo `ℤ/2`;\ncharge conjugation `C` is the residue of the continuous\nrotation upon imposing observability. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ComplexChiralityRotation.ChiralityInterpolationHolds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ComplexChiralityRotation.ChiralityInterpolationHolds","kind":"opaque","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/complex-chirality-rotation.lean#L31-L34","doc":"**Sub-claim (2: chirality interpolation)**: the chirality\noperator `X_φ : θ ↦ θ + φ` interpolates between identity\n(φ = 0) and full reversal (φ = π). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ComplexChiralityRotation.CrossingEnergyPhaseFactorHolds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ComplexChiralityRotation.CrossingEnergyPhaseFactorHolds","kind":"opaque","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/observations/complex-chirality-rotation.lean#L26-L29","doc":"**Sub-claim (1: phase factor on crossing energy)**: for any\ncrossing number `n_c`, the crossing energy at `q = |q|·exp(iθ)`\nis the real crossing energy times `exp(i·n_c·θ)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}